This project is a rebuild of TAB (https://github.com/NEZNAMY/TAB) for Horizon. TAB is
Copyright NEZNAMY and contributors and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Its source was read while writing this port;
no Java code was copied, but the behaviour of these parts follows it closely and they are
derivative works of TAB under the Apache License 2.0:

- core/src/sorting.rs      (Sorting, SortingType and its types, compressNumber)
- core/src/properties.rs   (YamlPropertyConfigurationFile.getProperty lookup order)
- core/src/conditions.rs   (ConditionalExpression operators, order and splitting)
- core/src/tabph.rs        (TabConstants placeholder names and refresh intervals)
- core/src/text.rs         (the RGB and gradient formats of RGBUtils)
- core/src/engine.rs       (the feature behaviour of header/footer, nametags, objectives,
                            scoreboard, boss bars)
- core/src/commands.rs     (sub-commands, arguments, permission nodes and messages, ported 1:1 from command/*.java)
- core/defaults/*.yml      (TAB's default config.yml, animations.yml, messages.yml,
                            groups.yml and users.yml, unchanged)

Changes: everything is rewritten in Rust for Horizon's engine; numbers in sort keys use a
smaller base (see core/src/sorting.rs); features listed as not ported in STATUS.md are absent.

The placeholder registry (core/src/placeholders/) is NOT derived from PlaceholderAPI, which is
GPL-3.0: its source was never opened. It follows only the placeholder syntax users know.

This project is not affiliated with TAB, NEZNAMY, PlaceholderAPI or HelpChat.
